To fix this issue, you should use .NET's UI thread synchronization mechanisms to make sure that UI updates are happening on the main UI thread. You can use the `Invoke` method to achieve this.

Modify your `LockDevice` method like this:

```csharp
private static void LockDevice(string whoBy)
